        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mariqueen Maandig Reznor, Pelle Almqvist, Trent Reznor, Atticus Ross\n- Products: An Omen EP, Welcome Oblivion\n- Roles: musicians, singers, songwriters, producer, collaborator\n\nFacts:\n- Pelle Almqvist was born on 29 May 1978 and is a Swedish singer and songwriter also known as Howlin' Pelle Almqvist.\n- Mariqueen Maandig Reznor was born on April 5, 1981 and is a Filipino American musician and singer-songwriter.\n- Trent Reznor is the frontman of Nine Inch Nails.\n- Atticus Ross is a longtime collaborator of Trent Reznor.\n- Trent Reznor, Mariqueen Maandig, and Atticus Ross produced the An Omen EP.\n- Various tracks from the An Omen EP were later issued on the 2013 debut album Welcome Oblivion.",
